+### AI Knowledge Workspaces
+
+#### [Flowise](https://github.com/FlowiseAI/Flowise)
+> **Description:** Flowise presents itself as a visual builder for AI agents and LLM workflows, and its README emphasizes drag-and-drop orchestration for chatflows, assistants, tools, and retrieval pipelines. For knowledge management, it is especially useful when teams want to connect models, vector stores, loaders, and custom logic without writing everything from scratch. The project is Apache-2.0 licensed and has a very active community around self-hosted agent workflows. GitHub snapshot: last commit `2026-03-30`, about `44,118` stars, primary language `TypeScript`, license `Apache-2.0`.
+
